        <div class="container">
            <!-- Section Header -->
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Students From Across Hyderabad</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">Quality tuition without the daily commute. Online classes on weekdays, in-person sessions on weekends.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Intro -->
            <div class="hybrid-intro">
                <p>Students from across Hyderabad learn with us — from Gachibowli to KPHB, Financial District to Secunderabad. Our hybrid model combines the convenience of online classes with the depth of weekend sessions at our Jubilee Hills centre. No more choosing between quality tuition and a 2-hour daily commute.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- How It Works - 3 Step Visual -->
            <div class="how-it-works">
                <h3>How It Works</h3>
                
                <div class="steps-container">
                    
                    <!-- Step 1 -->
                    <div class="step-card online">
                        <div class="step-badge">Step 1</div>
                        <h4>Weekday Online Classes</h4>
                        <p>Live small-batch sessions from home. Students solve problems, photograph their work, share via WhatsApp, and get real-time corrections. Same personal attention as sitting in a classroom — without the travel.</p>
                        <ul class="step-features">
                            <li>3-5 students per batch</li>
                            <li>Interactive, not lecture</li>
                            <li>Instant doubt clearing</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                    <!-- Connector -->
                    <div class="step-connector">
                        <span class="connector-line"></span>
                        <span class="connector-plus">+</span>
                        <span class="connector-line"></span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 2 -->
                    <div class="step-card offline">
                        <div class="step-badge">Step 2</div>
                        <h4>Weekend Offline Sessions</h4>
                        <p>Extended in-person classes at our Jubilee Hills centre every Saturday and Sunday. Deeper practice, doubt-clearing, tests, and focused revision. This is where concepts really solidify.</p>
                        <ul class="step-features">
                            <li>Saturday & Sunday</li>
                            <li>Extended sessions</li>
                            <li>In-person attention</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                    <!-- Connector -->
                    <div class="step-connector">
                        <span class="connector-line"></span>
                        <span class="connector-plus">+</span>
                        <span class="connector-line"></span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 3 -->
                    <div class="step-card flexible">
                        <div class="step-badge">Step 3</div>
                        <h4>Flexible Based on Need</h4>
                        <p>Students with weaker foundations start with more offline sessions (2 weekdays + weekends). As confidence builds, they transition to the online + weekend model. We adapt to what each student needs.</p>
                        <ul class="step-features">
                            <li>Personalized approach</li>
                            <li>Adapts to student needs</li>
                            <li>Builds confidence gradually</li>
                    </ul>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Why Online Works -->
            <div class="why-online">
                <h3>Why Online Classes Work</h3>
                
                <div class="online-features">
                    
                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
                        <h4>Same Attention, No Commute</h4>
                        <p>Small batches of 3-5 students mean everyone gets personal attention — whether in our classroom or on screen. We don't run large online lectures; this is interactive, guided practice.</p>
            </div>

                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">📸</div>
                        <h4>Real-Time Problem Correction</h4>
                        <p>Here's how it works: Student solves a problem → takes a photo → sends on WhatsApp → teacher checks immediately → corrects mistakes then and there. Faster feedback than waiting for homework to be checked next class.</p>
        </div>

                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">🖥️</div>
