                </div>

                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <div class="feature-icon">📚</div>
                        <h4>Weekend Depth</h4>
                        <p>Online handles regular practice. Weekends at the centre handle the deep work — tests, intensive revision, in-person doubt sessions, and exam preparation. The combination is stronger than either alone.</p>
                </div>

