                    <p>Concepts taught step-by-step (no rushing)</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-connector">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M9 18L15 12L9 6" stroke="#e5e7eb" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-step">
                    <div class="step-number-badge">3</div>
                    <h3>Practice Together</h3>
                    <p>We solve together, correct mistakes immediately</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-connector">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M9 18L15 12L9 6" stroke="#e5e7eb" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-step">
                    <div class="step-number-badge">4</div>
                    <h3>Practice Alone</h3>
                    <p>Students solve with structured homework</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-connector">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M9 18L15 12L9 6" stroke="#e5e7eb" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-step">
